@startuml state-diagram-archive-lifecycle
title Archive & Remote Mount Lifecycle

[*] --> Idle : App starts

state Idle {
    [*] --> NoArchive
}

state ArchiveOpen {
    [*] --> Browsing
    Browsing --> Extracting : extractSelected()
    Extracting --> Browsing : extraction complete
}

state RemoteMounted {
    [*] --> RemoteBrowsing
    RemoteBrowsing --> RemoteExtracting : extractNfsSelected()
    RemoteExtracting --> RemoteBrowsing : extraction complete
}

NoArchive --> ArchiveOpen   : openArchive(File)\n[xzip:// URI routed via FileSystemFactory]
ArchiveOpen --> NoArchive   : closeArchive()\nPROP_ARCHIVE_PATH fired

NoArchive --> RemoteMounted : mountNfs() / openMountUri(URI)\n[weefs:// URI routed via FileSystemFactory]\nPROP_REMOTE_MOUNTED fired
ArchiveOpen --> RemoteMounted : mountNfs()\n(archive stays open)

RemoteMounted --> NoArchive      : unmountNfs()\n[SFTP: closeArchive()]\nPROP_REMOTE_MOUNTED cleared
RemoteMounted --> ArchiveOpen    : unmountNfs()\n[legacy NFS: disconnects only]

ArchiveOpen --> [*]   : App exits
RemoteMounted --> [*] : App exits (connection closed)
NoArchive --> [*]     : App exits

note right of RemoteMounted
  ArchiveModel.isRemoteMounted() == true
  fires PROP_REMOTE_MOUNTED
  MenuBarFactory enables unmount/extract menus
end note

note right of ArchiveOpen
  FileSystemFactory.open(xzip://...) returns
  ExtZipFileSystem via ZipFileSystemDriver
end note
@enduml
